{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：棉签使用说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "3ef69e14aeff4934a6d74da89baa77c83b183ebf69dd9e352807a83d888f4bcf", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::step-1", "content": "1. 使用前确认包装完整、棉头无松脱，并核对商品标注的适用范围。", "content_sha256": "e2a9a00d0fda8cca881aa5b97d9b97b4aa9728f013ca7a019e89f48994f36605", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::step-2", "content": "2. 握住纸轴或杆体，轻柔清洁商品标签允许的外部区域。", "content_sha256": "3e1faf13978401349f2f8f0f9851ba3e681d82b6d24a36ed666939bc7c8529bb", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::step-3", "content": "3. 使用后立即丢弃并保持剩余棉签干燥、密封。", "content_sha256": "3d9b271f4836c86f4b89dd39306bb52793a5f01f9ed5ea844f4a98c0ce130447", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::warning-1", "content": "- 不得深入耳道、鼻腔或其他腔道。", "content_sha256": "efae2f4bc2ea4af0732cd95aac538f412d0ca0372234fff3912500ad554a6d45", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::warning-2", "content": "- 不得用于开放性伤口；儿童使用时应由成人看护。", "content_sha256": "d6f5ffadcb7f9f2a5a7a555354bb62dafc87d35d2f63fad0cf2517a5cda0b1d2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001::warning-3", "content": "- 棉头松脱、杆体弯折或包装破损时不要使用。", "content_sha256": "a5544dd5742dfec47736174298bfeaf5b5231e9dfc3e58ebf913e1f2368e7016", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-SWAB-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：棉柔巾与清洁巾使用说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "51053c9d70896b53a3eba27a02f1dd9f8c91d6b91ce9c42d281e924edafc4ff2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::step-1", "content": "1. 使用前核对包装上的材质、尺寸和适用部位，商品间不可共用参数。", "content_sha256": "03edc57dab917af2323a8d74f4dd750f0e291bc1c649365abf93183f496cd119", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::step-2", "content": "2. 干用时取单张轻柔擦拭；需要湿用时使用洁净水充分润湿后再擦拭。", "content_sha256": "c6863cf45e5f87fd73086063df201551abd9c6e854412321a5788c3f66070b4b", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::step-3", "content": "3. 用于婴幼儿时先在小范围试用，擦拭时避免反复摩擦同一部位。", "content_sha256": "6eeddcec6a52f650d90ed8a6143323458ef8e338f911772fcc675d46fc6a7c50", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::step-4", "content": "4. 使用后丢入垃圾桶，不冲入马桶；开封后保持包装封闭并存放于干燥处。", "content_sha256": "f214e6ddf5aebefea3515af242b5d274777fe63eccf526b3236c450e0638869c", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "step-4", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::warning-1", "content": "- 本说明不证明具体商品可用于口腔、伤口或卸妆；须以对应商品标签为准。", "content_sha256": "439bbadd8bdf541f6dd383318734cb52611a0761411e6c38450941648c4e3d24", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::warning-2", "content": "- 出现皮肤不适时停止使用；持续不适应咨询专业人员。", "content_sha256": "105bf3f043ec78b926306ac9ebd243de85f6b2b37f90aba22d3fe635b13088ad", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001::warning-3", "content": "- 一次性清洁用品不建议重复使用。", "content_sha256": "1ee82e0dc0717d860d11f1f9c61573dc37b35f345f6afccd82f2728f67afd221", "manual_id": "MANUAL-COTTON-WIPE-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：果干类食品食用与储存说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "6d9c9a6c8a26d3d62b849e34696495595bdf7c635f6bb29bfbab4e23f12fc764", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::step-1", "content": "1. 食用前核对包装完整性、配料表、生产日期和保质期。", "content_sha256": "9a66f7b7dedbb16bd7c5be2dcbbbd2d845b573d2b5685fb07a11b9f4530b81b1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::step-2", "content": "2. 开封后密封，并严格按包装标注的温度和期限储存。", "content_sha256": "97a28246b3719ea9eb692469c1b4e165dd7ac1d4e4159522d53c71285b8ab19f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::step-3", "content": "3. 取用时保持手部和容器清洁，避免产品受潮。", "content_sha256": "86a00e8d8bf25e99e06a75f9c503db08207f8869c7db09a3eb932d9f805964a4", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::warning-1", "content": "- 过敏或需要控制糖摄入的人群应先核对配料表和营养成分表。", "content_sha256": "0d54da47c81fb38924c4b0b5d6c1a8bbfe97d3034a67a356338a299b155af0ea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::warning-2", "content": "- 包装破损、胀袋、受潮、霉变或气味异常时不要食用。", "content_sha256": "9545198388b6fe799f5161263e44afcc9d76d1138ff1e10f99b6e4d399ebf297", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001::warning-3", "content": "- 本说明不声称任何保健或治疗效果。", "content_sha256": "8c880821c7541cbe8ec7f0c757c7720cbe176dfa7a7e743d31139914df280ae6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-DRIED-FRUIT-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：坚果类食品食用与储存说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "d0fc0bde48c7e79ff65d136feed85bf327a74c8e6a87c9b06d4236965f3d348e", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::step-1", "content": "1. 食用前检查包装、生产日期、保质期和配料表，并确认没有漏气或破损。", "content_sha256": "230e36f83ebb6e714f62aed676ff66a96b34d7a9122685a32cd3663c52da5f75", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::step-2", "content": "2. 开封后密封保存，按包装标注的温度、避光和食用期限要求处理。", "content_sha256": "a8c2910a7b4175f69250abb004e074068f15b16b8d8c3064f5df5887b0cf133d", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::step-3", "content": "3. 食用带壳坚果时注意清理碎壳，儿童和吞咽困难者应在看护下食用。", "content_sha256": "49c267548ab5e0432de4557afd4128db81494d3c5cd1b9c7e49844ad0ff473ec", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::warning-1", "content": "- 坚果可能引起过敏，过敏人群应核对配料及交叉污染提示。", "content_sha256": "2b5967c32001d5705f74dd9f80cfd886e480032952065e82d29f4d93a4bb1134", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::warning-2", "content": "- 出现霉味、哈喇味、异常潮湿、虫蛀或包装胀袋时不要食用。", "content_sha256": "cec4002c17debae88a1f12cc74538dfb9edc3f46d44acd94a47d81a47553c2fc", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001::warning-3", "content": "- 具体储存条件和保质期只能引用对应包装，不从同类商品推断。", "content_sha256": "ca81c8d0df9812225144caaedc4eed188f194ba85a99332257685d8ca0a470a2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-NUTS-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：抽纸与生活用纸使用说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "87767ea9c6ab74710fd218cc7685e002e37d35aa7fa1b5d2f187a32316a14305", "manual_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001::step-1", "content": "1. 开封前确认包装完整，按包装标识的用途取用。", "content_sha256": "ad30235a4227af8defecb7b30f48cd01ffc05821c7578aa7c622f1a7ca9f0393", "manual_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001::step-2", "content": "2. 开封后存放于清洁、干燥处，避免受潮和污染。", "content_sha256": "fde27ec630302998ef77ae835b6d6fd118024170ee0dd1e0cf0b55298271a790", "manual_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001::step-3", "content": "3. 使用后按当地垃圾分类要求处理。", "content_sha256": "7309fe7a2586e59acee014927f8f524e40334b03bfb45ce31078430cffc7f4b5", "manual_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001::warning-1", "content": "- 是否可接触口鼻、食品或用于婴幼儿，应以具体商品标签为准。", "content_sha256": "53d60b9f60b4dc9bb1bf08bc9126f7183b7ad515721fbd42c3a537e2075b4310", "manual_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001::warning-2", "content": "- 本模拟说明不替代商品包装上的卫生标准、执行标准或保质信息。", "content_sha256": "f63bfafe0dc8297ea9d775b0f4c3a8e2af6701ce5bdc37d26ff892a65e5f7e40", "manual_id": "MANUAL-PAPER-TISSUE-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：粽子与青团类食品加热食用说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "fea8fe794e34433977066ff52dbb5c5fcc69cc6f1b645a6982e091870fbb0b29", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::step-1", "content": "1. 先核对包装是否完整、是否在保质期内，以及标签要求的储存状态。", "content_sha256": "d3b8bb0dfb7baf968f74d6cb96eb6c45236ab1841b92bf513d2a3263862d6c51", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::step-2", "content": "2. 按对应包装标注的蒸、煮或微波方式充分加热；不同包装不可直接套用同一时间。", "content_sha256": "c4fcfe2c875d0bb3ad7d659cf18c960b54f419ff040252d1aa5046d26115504f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::step-3", "content": "3. 加热后小心蒸汽和高温馅料，稍微放凉后再食用。", "content_sha256": "327276e5e0ea8fa709287791571dd9daddf6a54c9a673550f485523b9f9da293", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::warning-1", "content": "- 真空包装是否需要冷藏、是否可直接微波，必须以具体包装说明为准。", "content_sha256": "765647921e05dd06be9d38e9604ef3442734609cce2287241364ac68ecd7d7fd", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::warning-2", "content": "- 包装胀袋、漏气、霉变、异味或储存条件不明时不要食用。", "content_sha256": "d16b9dfd061e0dfc33b85bb1096d39b8cf213eddeeb3415e97ea9a593bac3684", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001::warning-3", "content": "- 食物含过敏原或特殊配料时，以配料表和过敏原提示为准。", "content_sha256": "4437e71b99ae7a29cc1f13823d6483d237f7337222ed76d0fca6c1d26e5126ad", "manual_id": "MANUAL-RICE-PASTRY-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：茶刀、茶针与开茶工具使用说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "a481affdcce3b2ae0b5214d8d5f0db8d088258906dde76097981ef3120625073", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::step-1", "content": "1. 将茶饼放在稳定、防滑的平面上，确认工具手柄与连接处完好。", "content_sha256": "70764c9a4b843b284d9cda0a19147654728fbb745fb6cc3c8ced713d3182bb39", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::step-2", "content": "2. 从茶饼侧面缝隙缓慢插入，沿纹理小幅撬动，不朝向身体或他人。", "content_sha256": "5381295fd5a637cbd760c8fc8a56182335d73d13762b5d8839208492b2f5945f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::step-3", "content": "3. 使用后清除碎屑，擦干工具并套好保护套，存放在儿童接触不到的位置。", "content_sha256": "12c02aa89b28bf26b52afba06d648cdc994128a0f7a8b37537c8772e6c6e1f5f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::warning-1", "content": "- 工具尖锐，不可作为儿童用品。", "content_sha256": "e50effbd895997fd00d7036753d1d15ee233d688acdc323e479a671176d7166d", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::warning-2", "content": "- 不要用手掌抵住刀尖方向，不要以过大力量扭转或敲击。", "content_sha256": "664be87055524e0886d00e388d175e112678c96b7d9dd0fa3125d47b00d91aeb", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001::warning-3", "content": "- 手柄松动、刀体开裂或明显锈蚀时停止使用。", "content_sha256": "7cb55bc125f17cb7ecab772bbceb99865a8474027212ca31d83d0c6e1796e7e0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TOOL-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::overview-1", "content": "适用范围：木质茶盘使用与保养说明（模拟）。本文件仅用于研究系统模拟，不代表真实厂商说明书。", "content_sha256": "a849589ec66f9250f8300f421099f5f5d7fa1a81afb11d7964982bc85afc9a93", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "overview-1", "section_title": "适用范围", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::step-1", "content": "1. 首次使用前用柔软湿布擦拭，并置于通风处自然干燥。", "content_sha256": "9349d2dd9d87a5efdc376e0919c4921820c249cbb397426ac87acf92b78bd802", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "step-1", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::step-2", "content": "2. 使用时及时清理积水和茶渍，避免长时间浸泡。", "content_sha256": "90be053052455587a02bbe1f73784e0f56b93e75318bf3a255db51bd4a05924e", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "step-2", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::step-3", "content": "3. 清洁后顺木纹擦干，放置在阴凉通风处。", "content_sha256": "1b588ccafccb9f2347a1b6e59bbc647b263e6bc87e6f9b9aee0ecb9b0c51d87a", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "step-3", "section_title": "使用步骤", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::warning-1", "content": "- 不要使用钢丝球、强酸强碱清洁剂或洗碗机。", "content_sha256": "600bb128fdf8c1d2f33aaec7d53c277b176ab5c0c99629dab42468fc5ac3ade6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "warning-1", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::warning-2", "content": "- 避免暴晒、火源和剧烈温湿度变化，以减少开裂或变形风险。", "content_sha256": "6e76d712a897292d97fcadd931a84b9c351f0976feaa0d9ad0d9b36d6114b703", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "warning-2", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001::warning-3", "content": "- 具体材质和排水结构以对应商品页面及实物为准。", "content_sha256": "3fe47c6eb6ef4e65cac309a7c2b8ec382b83f460ae2978af46fb2f25026fdc02", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-TRAY-001", "section_id": "warning-3", "section_title": "注意事项", "source_tier": "legacy_category"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::overview", "content": "本品为婴儿细轴棉签，由棉头和纸轴组成，仅用于外耳廓等外部区域的轻柔清洁。", "content_sha256": "12a03352894ea95fa674cf0c71dc06c3012cc9b9fead3864c5811d444735710f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "产品介绍", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::before_use", "content": "使用前检查包装是否完整、棉头是否松脱、纸轴是否弯折。任一异常时不要使用。清洁者应先洗净并擦干双手。", "content_sha256": "cb513056982cdba9a32c4b8df82cb67a508f17d51aeff9735fb8a84478e631c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "section_id": "before_use", "section_title": "使用前检查", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::operation", "content": "让儿童保持稳定姿势，仅用棉头轻擦看得见的外耳廓部位。每支使用一次，使用后立即丢弃。", "content_sha256": "caaaed4d2ea447a84a99dcff368822c572d92b864dc72e74f64552782a184abc", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "section_id": "operation", "section_title": "外耳廓清洁方法", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::prohibitions", "content": "不得将棉签伸入耳道，不得在儿童突然移动时继续操作，不得自行蘸酒精、药液或其他不明液体处理耳内问题。", "content_sha256": "a60d4b954c8edbeca31c3d12a16ad09b5830192a3e159fc3fa76d5623cfda580", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "section_id": "prohibitions", "section_title": "禁止事项", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::storage", "content": "未使用的棉签应保持包装封闭，存放于干燥处并远离儿童可自行取得的位置。用过的棉签不得重复使用。", "content_sha256": "17eb478f00c437533cd185026f0f708e5dedcab0f182f7762f3c99ab1b81eda0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存与处置", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::escalation", "content": "若出现持续干燥、疼痛、流血、异常分泌物或听力变化，应停止自行清洁并咨询专业医务人员。说明书不提供疾病诊断。", "content_sha256": "015954429f3cfc4276adcfc4be2612ab72facb0e2a0f5d058595e4948c1cf309", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "section_id": "escalation", "section_title": "停止使用与就医提示", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::overview", "content": "本品为植物纤维制成的婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾，商品记录为无添加香味，可按包装适用范围用于宝宝日常清洁。", "content_sha256": "d431c4bc15cd6f22239acd9f2850af7726d08a948316c653a3ff322392c63738", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "产品介绍", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::dry_use", "content": "从包装中取出单张，用于轻柔吸干水分或擦拭日常可见污渍。不要在同一皮肤部位反复用力摩擦。", "content_sha256": "755d317ceb3738578c0a7e4540b8b1ed83eb1288822a9f08c65a8d79775a0247", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "section_id": "dry_use", "section_title": "干用方法", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::wet_use", "content": "需要湿用时，以洁净的适温水充分润湿单张棉柔巾并轻轻挤去多余水分，再用于日常外部清洁。不得自行加入消毒剂、香精或药液。", "content_sha256": "d5c657889950643d3044e324e298d59ecc200cf7fe137a404973211380de1719", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "section_id": "wet_use", "section_title": "湿用方法", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::baby_care", "content": "清洁宝宝臀部时应由清洁区域向污染区域单向轻擦，必要时更换新的一张；清洁后让皮肤保持干爽。", "content_sha256": "b3c3acd68cd8c990c0f41a9b638dec255b0379d0f9002318e4e9f7a442ce5646", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "section_id": "baby_care", "section_title": "宝宝臀部清洁", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::storage", "content": "开封后及时封好包装，置于清洁干燥处，避免受潮和污染。本品为一次性用品，使用后放入垃圾桶，不冲入马桶。", "content_sha256": "78ab059e118128fec509c1fc8f88186014f72ea7bca6188765e935463c8e70a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存与处置", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::troubleshooting", "content": "首次使用可先在小范围观察。若出现持续发红、刺痛或其他不适，应停止使用；症状持续时咨询专业医务人员。无添加香味不等于任何人都不会敏感。", "content_sha256": "4079775d1b5bb35a122be8cd4db99ee4cef403ae0bb135e387da38ed38c6ac07", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "异常情况", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::overview", "content": "本品基材为植物纤维无纺布，并非纯棉；商品包装标注可用于婴儿手口日常外部清洁。包装所称“九丝”指包装袋厚度，不是擦巾材质或单张厚度。", "content_sha256": "6008e09cb50bdb7dfc8d8793503d2b38027b68712dd86513d43e5b6aefcf68aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "产品介绍", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::before_use", "content": "使用前确认包装密封正常，擦巾没有异味、明显变色或污染。手口清洁前，成人应先清洁双手。", "content_sha256": "51c41db4a870aa355d967915a8e16367d1597cc1506ee0a6395acb7e49b618a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "section_id": "before_use", "section_title": "使用前检查", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::operation", "content": "取出单张后轻柔擦拭手部和口周皮肤。擦拭口周时避开眼睛和口腔内部；污渍较多时更换新的一张，不来回使用已污染的一面。", "content_sha256": "69371607a5e17b713d828623515ce786f5c765ce101760b66b1243259c0bfd31", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "section_id": "operation", "section_title": "手口清洁方法", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::limits", "content": "“手口适用”仅指包装允许的日常外部清洁，不代表可食用、可用于口腔内部、开放性伤口或替代消毒产品。", "content_sha256": "ab90a1cb22df7834e9d1c559b97f538e2bdda127c5ff2d53cf239e441174ed2f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "section_id": "limits", "section_title": "适用边界", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::storage", "content": "每次取用后立即封口，避免高温、阳光直射和污染。擦巾变干后不要自行添加来源不明的液体继续使用。", "content_sha256": "f6cce76286d0cbc769601d2f2adfdc84b88295f5045bfabf72ffe81db78620a4", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "开封后保存", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::troubleshooting", "content": "建议首次小范围试用。出现刺激、持续发红或皮肤破损时停止使用；如症状持续，应咨询专业医务人员。", "content_sha256": "076888f414bb946d03536afbf8d2ca90ab01328d83a1473c69adb5b07c3d81d1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "不适处理", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::specification", "content": "本款尺寸为70×140厘米，采用婴儿可用亲肤面料，适合新生儿洗浴后的包裹和擦干。", "content_sha256": "63eb984991b64b03be4bbed266920bb2664ebf1f204248d7a8963e945ec6791f", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "section_id": "specification", "section_title": "规格与用途", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::first_wash", "content": "首次使用前应单独用清水或婴幼儿衣物适用的温和洗涤剂清洗，充分漂洗后完全晾干。深浅色织物不要混洗。", "content_sha256": "476ed32367ccce9363ed19a1838fe8ad6abc3ef2258d50e0ac6d421ba4de4ef0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "section_id": "first_wash", "section_title": "首次使用", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::drying", "content": "洗浴后先用浴巾包裹身体，再以轻压吸水的方式擦干褶皱部位；不要用力来回摩擦皮肤。使用时确保口鼻不被织物遮挡。", "content_sha256": "c5485738d0afa294afb8ea8e23e280dd60c45ecaf2f60d31f9e5ee250621331a", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "section_id": "drying", "section_title": "包裹与擦干", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::laundry", "content": "使用后及时清洗并完全晾干。不要长时间湿放，不使用强漂白剂，不与明显污染的衣物混洗。", "content_sha256": "08c6416c6fde2d8da3a1e8ff3d44f4061f872001cbd0f8137cb56926ee057ea8", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "section_id": "laundry", "section_title": "日常清洗", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::storage", "content": "完全干燥后折叠存放于清洁通风处。长期存放前确认没有潮气，避免密闭保存湿浴巾。", "content_sha256": "e04b491175881ccf8b910ab892b8f196755d770366140d1868f72b624bb8f579", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::troubleshooting", "content": "若出现持续异味、霉点、明显脱线或粗糙硬化，应停止给婴儿使用。轻微浮毛应先按清洗说明处理，不能据此保证绝对零掉毛。", "content_sha256": "970082436beb35581ebb9c1ad2e13b99ba9132927761537299cde6284cc66a7b", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "异常处理", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::variants", "content": "本系列为纯棉纱布用品。4层款更轻薄，6层款为常规吸水款；九月底待产若主要考虑日常吸水性，通常优先6层，最终仍应按具体用途选择。", "content_sha256": "adaf4a4a989e6555b59ad0cb220148c886fca39e89b646e88c03a9381bb1960d", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "section_id": "variants", "section_title": "款式差异", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::choose", "content": "用于轻便口水巾等需要快速干燥的场景可考虑4层；用于较强吸水需求可考虑6层。商品记录未规定所有用途，购买前应先确认准备作为哪类用品。", "content_sha256": "d95f21db61428e79d267dcf8639185bb273d6d8ddbbf793a212b61f447981837", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "section_id": "choose", "section_title": "按用途选择", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::first_wash", "content": "首次使用前单独清洗，充分漂洗并完全晾干。纱布洗后出现轻微自然褶皱属于结构表现，不应为追求平整而高温熨烫。", "content_sha256": "33e8e2e89936156cd7fcf62a629422cee76bef0fe5eb5d0cb3c0335f9f556420", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "section_id": "first_wash", "section_title": "首次清洗", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::daily_use", "content": "使用时轻压吸水，不在婴儿皮肤上反复用力摩擦。被口水或其他液体明显浸湿后及时更换。", "content_sha256": "f76fac6f61413a289c2f43a03ea8f89b660da0a7a93cb2c6af9eb3db450b70b5", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "section_id": "daily_use", "section_title": "日常使用", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::laundry", "content": "使用温和洗涤方式，不用强漂白剂，不与明显污染物混洗。清洗后展开并在通风处完全晾干。", "content_sha256": "0b1e6c86bdf1facff5f996e22e5fda5463a3faac403812fb8ed9d9c347f0a4b0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "section_id": "laundry", "section_title": "清洗与晾晒", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::troubleshooting", "content": "出现霉点、持续异味、破洞或明显线头松脱时停止使用。不同层数不代表固定季节，也不能仅凭预产月份替代用途判断。", "content_sha256": "bb53e9cf60157bee17098844899715cd66aa5dd96934917388048221402f5c8d", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "异常处理", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::components", "content": "护理垫用于隔离污物、保护床面；刀纸用于产后清洁。两者用途不同，不能互相替代。", "content_sha256": "9133f1b34deb0a17448bc55ea8bc262d2d4401781a65e00dc36f802d07fd40ec", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "section_id": "components", "section_title": "套装组成与用途", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::care_pad", "content": "将吸收面朝上、隔水面朝向床面平整铺放。垫面被明显污染、浸湿或移位后应及时更换。", "content_sha256": "a2c45e8c849200b0b1eec0e55f5104e6a5fba4d343ac9dfa447cc52059b074d3", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "section_id": "care_pad", "section_title": "护理垫使用", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::paper", "content": "取适量刀纸用于外部清洁，动作应轻柔；每次使用后按护理场所要求处置，不冲入马桶。", "content_sha256": "089a9e774b613fedb124cf2a37394a59d62ea148538cbaa7bd33e5d6759b9af4", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "section_id": "paper", "section_title": "刀纸使用", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::quantity", "content": "本说明书不规定固定购买数量。应结合医院待产清单、预计住院时间、每包片数或张数，以及医院是否提供相关用品后决定。", "content_sha256": "395a0909e716d33c9f46b3183239cf7c482dd4fb30f85ce95c319408ee5fe724", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "section_id": "quantity", "section_title": "备货数量", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::storage", "content": "未使用用品应保持包装完整，放在清洁干燥处。开封后避免与已污染用品混放。", "content_sha256": "913021f384b235c0975d0dd0612b2e0952002124669fac6d4d7d936253eddcd0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::limits", "content": "本套装是日常护理用品，不提供医疗效果。具体伤口护理、消毒或特殊健康情况应遵循医院和专业医务人员指导。", "content_sha256": "e38b3a59b742234d39828248ea2214f5a30f9a4c13f78ab875eb12a461aa6645", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "section_id": "limits", "section_title": "使用边界", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::selection", "content": "茶针适合沿茶饼缝隙细致撬茶，较少破坏茶叶；茶刀适合撬取较大的块状茶。选择主要取决于茶饼紧实程度和目标块度，不只看工具大小。", "content_sha256": "ffdbfcf20a6211e085a5a98dfeb5b8f04143f62ffe9f2e009894e0d599725e54", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "section_id": "selection", "section_title": "工具选择", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::inspection", "content": "检查尖端、刀体和手柄连接处是否完好。若有松动、裂纹、明显锈蚀或保护套破损，应停止使用。", "content_sha256": "5db317434b474b752f300178c1acec7c1ca3a798f861f7192cf38e63d2f6f58c", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "section_id": "inspection", "section_title": "使用前检查", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::operation", "content": "将茶饼放在稳定防滑的平面，从侧面可见缝隙缓慢插入工具，尖端始终背离手掌和身体；小幅撬动后退出，再换相邻位置重复，不强行扭转。", "content_sha256": "c41df185add1a141dd2061732fb17dcd185abf269a3297b478f99d3fafcf8915", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "section_id": "operation", "section_title": "开茶步骤", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::hard_tea", "content": "若阻力明显，不要敲击工具或朝身体方向加力。应退出后寻找新的自然缝隙，必要时改用更适合大块撬取的茶刀，并分多次操作。", "content_sha256": "241c4b89b7d9bf727522347f13b2c4f591208c0be15f4036c41ffbd50c402adb", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "section_id": "hard_tea", "section_title": "过紧时处理", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::cleaning", "content": "使用后清除茶屑，以柔软干布擦净并充分干燥，套好保护套后存放在儿童接触不到的位置。", "content_sha256": "3741342c64270993333bf9ecb3a448313950601e67d2887be24f9e666431c94b", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "section_id": "cleaning", "section_title": "清洁与储存", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::warnings", "content": "工具尖锐，不可作为儿童用品，不得用手掌抵住尖端方向，不得用于撬茶之外的用途。发生刺伤时先停止操作并按实际伤情处理。", "content_sha256": "01b9199f323e351d178a6edda7e03dfa86bceb6efc9b1b701b05629321d96269", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "section_id": "warnings", "section_title": "安全警告", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::overview", "content": "本品为即食红枣，商品记录标注可开袋直接食用，无需再次烹煮。食用与保存仍以对应包装标识为准。", "content_sha256": "22a0955b5db4696ec8a2dec9db097cb8e027ef67ebf2b5b2aa8d43431590ac23", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "食用方式", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::before_eating", "content": "检查包装是否完整并核对包装上的保质信息。开袋后若发现霉点、虫蛀、异常潮湿或明显异味，不要食用。", "content_sha256": "146c6875b990ec891acce7619349421834bfa7ab38df347c6f0a885e9c8ed1a7", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "section_id": "before_eating", "section_title": "食用前检查", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::serving", "content": "使用清洁干燥的手或容器取食，取食后及时封口。儿童、老年人或吞咽能力受限者食用时应注意枣核和噎食风险。", "content_sha256": "88ab5c559e6aaa7d1a71117d6c93ebd48c75a18e9e8640f3228d6d43e89f14a5", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "section_id": "serving", "section_title": "取食", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::storage", "content": "开封后密封，按包装标注的温度、避光条件和期限保存。说明书没有给出统一的开封后天数，不能脱离包装自行承诺。", "content_sha256": "09093e02bd0080a65a53f51a8a469b531fdceade9cf77b2b05f0e6fa92c5c43b", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "开封后保存", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::abnormal", "content": "产品出现霉变、酸败样异味、虫蛀或包装异常时应停止食用并保留商品与包装信息。已经食用后若出现持续不适，应及时咨询专业医务人员。", "content_sha256": "f1f0f6b569085f61b55493c9e2f05b63f8e13a66710eb567c3e09e14223bc3cf", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "section_id": "abnormal", "section_title": "异常情况", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::limits", "content": "本说明书不声称补血、治疗或其他保健功效，也不提供孕妇、慢性病患者或特定人群的个体化食用量建议。", "content_sha256": "f356f1dcd35e4ecdf25f0753dc82bfbd6c802663701080daab2a185c21b82805", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "section_id": "limits", "section_title": "信息边界", "source_tier": "frozen_product"}
